                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Unplayable on modern machines. As in cannot even reach 30fps, mouse constantly tries to reorient to center, bad clipping, plus some terrible quality of life such as no keybind or graphical options while in-game (only main menu), no native 16:9 resolutions. I'm assuming the only reason the reviews are positive is due to people modding the game in some way, which is not something I'm interested in doing simply to play it.\n\nIt's a shame. It looked good otherwise and had well done cinematics, if a tad cartoony.",
